Major modifications from upstream SlimeVR-Server:
- Tauri desktop shell (gui/tauri/) replacing the upstream Electron host, with
  one-time data migration from the earlier dev.slimevr.tauri-spike identifier.
- Redesigned React interface (gui/app/src/) with top navigation, responsive
  tracker cards, PawPad themes (Bun, Fox, Dog), User Agreement, and Open Source
  Licenses screens.
- Server tracking additions: adaptive drift compensation, pose stability
  estimation, tracker recovery states, UDP connection registry, playout buffer,
  automatic full reset, lying yaw reset, zero-slide foot clamp, tracker
  telemetry logging, and a loopback-default WebSocket API boundary.
- SolarXR protocol extensions (sj-custom branch) for osc_rate, tracker recovery,
  adaptive drift, and filter health.
- ESP32 USB dongle receiver and bridge (tools/esp32-dongle/), macOS launcher
  (Start Bun Tracker.command), VRChat chatbox tools (Apple Music, BPM, dictation),
  and Quest StreamCast remote control.

